      <pubDate>Sat, 12 Sep 2026 18:43:46 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a98012919fe2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a98013fc79db.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a98015bc1031.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9805f92f422.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a980601652cd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9806051e5a0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Weapon Fixes&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Change&lt;/em&gt;: Made the Hookshot unbreakable&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Change&lt;/em&gt;: Added all the weapons (except the Twilight Scimitar from the Triforce area) to Cherry&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod adds a new quest to the game called "The Twilight Island".&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It also adds a totally new mechanic into the game: a (kinda) working Hookshot!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;To start the quest you have to talk to Ordon link (a new npc) at link's house.&lt;br&gt;Go watch the video if you want more information.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;There i also a secret/easter egg in this mod, beacause while you're playing you might notice i big triforce in the distance outside of hyrule wich you can actually go to with this mod's new kind of working hookshot!&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Contents of this mod:&lt;br&gt; 1 quest&lt;br&gt;4 swords&lt;br&gt;1 shield&lt;br&gt;1 hookshot&lt;br&gt;5 enemies&lt;br&gt;1 npc&lt;br&gt;1 new item&lt;br&gt;1 new mask&lt;br&gt;and various map objects.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you want to make mods like this one join my studio: https://gamebanana.com/studios/39493</description>
