    <item>
      <title>Dobule Handed Weapon Buff</title>
      <author>Aeyozea</author>
      <link>https://gamebanana.com/mods/714290</link>
      <comments>https://gamebanana.com/mods/714290#PostsListModule</comments>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">77a3a7d9148c8c4ad2c424ff7f287aba37c9a87e</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 09:12:30 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9c393b661c9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a9c3998df729.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;Necessary buffs have been made to two-handed weapons, including &lt;b&gt;Large Swords&lt;/b&gt; and &lt;b&gt;Spears&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;In Zelda, giving up the ability to &lt;b&gt;use a shield at all times&lt;/b&gt; comes with a very high opportunity cost, so &lt;strong&gt;two handed weapons should have an overwhelming damage advantage over swords&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Change 1: Weapon stat adjustments&lt;br&gt;The stats of weapons of the same tier now strictly follow the ratio:&lt;br&gt;Sword : Large Sword : Spear = 1 : 2 : 0.9&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For example:&lt;br&gt;Savage Lynel Sword: 58—100&lt;br&gt;Savage Lynel Crusher: 116—200&lt;br&gt;Savage Lynel Spear: 52—90&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;58:116:52 = 100:200:90 = 1:2:0.9&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Change 2: Increase attack speed&lt;br&gt;Large Sword and Spear attack speeds increased by 10–50% (varies by move).&lt;br&gt;Examples:&lt;br&gt;Large Sword Spin attack: +10%,but its charging charge phase: +50%.&lt;br&gt;Spear dash attack: +50% speed, animation shortened by 10 frames,but Spear flurry rush attack only +20%.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod pushes the output of Large Swords' and Spears' DPS to a level that &lt;b&gt;swords simply cannot compete with.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;It also greatly improves the overall feel of using them, making it easier to deal with highly agile enemies, such as &lt;b&gt;Golden Lizalfos in the late game of Master Mode.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Huge thanks to &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/members/2731381"&gt;@neowine&lt;/a&gt;, @初音ミク.sbactorpack//AS/Manjiro.bas です！！, and @Nebroc.bfevfl for helping out, and to everyone in the Zelda BOTW Modding Discord/Community. &lt;br&gt;This mod wouldn't exist without your help and this awesome community — even if it's just a little personal project.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;— Better  install with &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/tools/12110"&gt;UKMM&lt;/a&gt; (not required, but without it, you’re more likely to run into compatibility issues)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;— Highly likely incompatible with other mods that modify stats or animations.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;— If you encounter any bugs, please report them ASAP, and I will do my best to fix them.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/ukmm_dobule_handed_weapon_buff.zip" type="application/zip"/>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/source_files_dobule_handed_weapon_buff.zip" type="application/zip"/>
